<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33025" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτοθι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>out of, outside, far from</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῶν, πυλάων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.391
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.439
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.243
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέο δ᾽ ἔ. μῆτις
				ὄρωρεν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1291
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>outside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.255
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>without</i>, i.e. <i>not having</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					22.252
				</span></i>
			,al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
